-- The DAO of restrictkit (S7 s5, Q-S7-18 (a)): a copy of daokit.lang. A kit
-- file: each constant comes from the host (the tags and the share keys of
-- examples/ballot.lang; the rest from `build/ballottool rdao`). The ring is
-- zkKey 17, 36, 2 (Q-S7-20 (a)): the H_p counters at w are 0, 7, 3, each
-- below the 8 tries of the chain H_p loop. The ring signs at the context
-- word w = hash selfWord 1 (zkVerifyAt), so a ballot of a second contract
-- does not verify here. When yes > no, enact
-- also calls setCapN (proposal) on restrictkit at kitAddr (the call form).
-- A cast is four calls under the nullifier N = hash (hash ix iy) poll (the
-- zkcast key, O33): castSig checks the ring signature over the 8 slot
-- ciphertext words and keeps them in pend at hash N k (k = 4 j + i, slot j,
-- word i of c1x c1y c2x c2y); castSlot checks the OR proof of slot j on the
-- kept words; castSeal checks the sum proof, adds slot 0 to T0 and slot 1 to
-- T1 (the c1 and c2 points, from (0, 0), the identity of ecAdd) and marks N
-- used. stage holds 1 at N after castSig and 1 at hash N j after the proof of
-- slot j; a second castSig of a pending N starts N again. enact opens T0 with
-- the shares of the quorum {1, 2} (the Lagrange constants l1 l2 are contract
-- constants, O31): yes = m, no = casts - yes, and the window moves to the
-- proposal when yes > no (a tie keeps it). The fill and cancel are slice b5.
state State := makeState (used : Map U256 Flag) (pend : Map U256 U256) (stage : Map U256 U256) (t0ax : U256) (t0ay : U256) (t0bx : U256) (t0by : U256) (t1ax : U256) (t1ay : U256) (t1bx : U256) (t1by : U256) (casts : U256) (castEnd : U256) (proposal : U256) (window : U256) (enacted : Flag) (keys : Map U256 Flag) (fills : Map U256 U256)

-- castEnd 10, proposal 4, window 6.
def init : State := makeState mapEmpty mapEmpty mapEmpty 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 10u 4u 6u flagNo mapEmpty mapEmpty

-- The address word of this contract, restrictkit (the receiver of
-- test/evmchain.sh) and its setter setCapN (uint256).
def selfWord : Env -> U256 := fun (e : Env) => addrToU256 (self e)
def kitAddr : Addr := 0x0000000000000000000000007265636569766572
call setCapN (to : Addr) (v : U256)

